{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "dcc096d2-f7f8-8961-9cec-59a2715c051f",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T12:48:10-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Susan Sisson",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:42:32-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:42:39-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. Sorry, I'm going to keep my voice down. Somebody's sleeping in the back seat. I'm in the car, parked, with the window cracked open for air."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:42:56-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's fine, take your time. I can hear you okay. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:43:05-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The plow. It came through Sunday night, Monday morning, whenever, with that snow-to-rain thing last weekend. And it went by once. One time. And now it's all frozen over."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:43:23-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the plow went through once during the storm and what's left has frozen. Which street are you on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:43:36-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Coggeshall Avenue. 280 Coggeshall. Up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:43:42-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "280 Coggeshall Avenue, Historic Hill. Got it. And what's the situation there, is the road itself not cleared?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:43:53-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's cleared down the middle. But the berm, the pile at the edge, it's like a wall. Hard as concrete now. Cars along the curb are stuck, and there's no path to the sidewalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:44:14-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mm-hm. So the plow left a ridge along the curb and it's frozen solid."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:44:23-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. And I've got a neighbor, she's elderly, lives alone next to me. She can't get out. She can't climb over that. She has appointments and she can't even get to the road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:44:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And she's at the same address, or next door?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:44:50-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Next door. Um, the house right beside 280. But it's the same stretch, same pile."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:45:00-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right, I'll note it as the stretch by 280 Coggeshall, with an elderly neighbor who needs a path cleared. Is anyone able to shovel for her in the meantime?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:45:19-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I tried. [pause] I tried this morning. It's ice. My shovel just bounced. I'm not, I can't do that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:45:31-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's understandable. Frozen after rain like that, it's tough going."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:45:38-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I'm asking if a plow can come back. Just once more. Push it back and open a gap."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:45:50-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put in the request for a return pass on Coggeshall near 280. Let me read it back. Plow came through Sunday night into Monday, berm frozen at the curb, elderly neighbor blocked in, needs an opening. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:46:14-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. That's it. Honestly it should have been done right the first time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:46:23-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. The rain on top of the snow made a mess of a lot of streets. I'll make sure the note says there's someone who can't get out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:46:42-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. When would that be, roughly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:46:46-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Crews are working through a list of those today and tomorrow. I'd say you're looking at sometime in the next day or so, depending on where the request falls."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:47:04-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A day or so. Great. [pause] Sorry, hold on. Okay, she's still out. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:47:14-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Do you want a call if the crew has trouble reaching it? I have a number for you if you'd like to give it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:47:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0175."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:47:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0175. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:47:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Susan Sisson. S-I-S-S-O-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:47:39-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Ms. Sisson. So that's Susan Sisson, 280 Coggeshall Avenue, plow return for the frozen berm, elderly neighbor next door. I've got it logged."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:47:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thanks. I'm going to go before she wakes up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:48:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course. Take care, and stay warm out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T12:48:08-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mm. Bye."
    }
  ],
